@token = 1000000000

### 1. Get account info
GET http://localhost:4040/accounts/260970000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get balance
GET http://localhost:4040/accounts/260970000000/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get ledger
GET http://localhost:4040/accounts/260970000000/ledger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get a quote
POST http://localhost:4040/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "260970000000",
  "amount": 100.0,
  "currency": "ZMW"
}

### 5. Reserve funds (payee side)
POST http://localhost:4040/funds/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "260970000000",
  "amount": 100.0,
  "currency": "ZMW"
}

### 6. Commit a reservation (payee side)
POST http://localhost:4040/funds/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reserve_id": "520fc3d5-f405-41ff-96e1-032223a80774"
}

### 7. Unreserve (payee side)
POST http://localhost:4040/funds/unreserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reserve_id": "f7f64a01-8281-4471-8790-5ad3834a8838",
  "reason": "downstream transfer failed"
}

### 8. Refund a debit (payer side)
POST http://localhost:4040/debits/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "home_transaction_id": "HTX17F0A9CCB904",
  "reason": "transfer failed downstream after debit"
}

### 9. Simulate: ask for a quote (stands in for the app)
POST http://localhost:4040/simulate/send-money
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payer_account_id": "260970000000",
  "payee_id": "16135551212",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "send_currency": "ZMW",
  "receive_currency": "MWK"
}

### 10. Simulate: accept a quote (stands in for the app)
POST http://localhost:4040/simulate/accept-quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXN16066DE18E324CA4",
  "home_transaction_id": "HTX17F0A9CCB904",
  "payer_account_id": "260970000000",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "ZMW"
}
